========================================================================================

This directory cross-validates the drain-scan scanner against an INDEPENDENT labelled
corpus: the `access_control` category of SmartBugs-Curated. It is split=external - NOT part
of the drain-bench real-incident corpus, NOT in bench/dataset/manifest.tsv, and it does not
affect any benchmark number.

Upstream dataset
----------------
  SmartBugs-Curated - https://github.com/smartbugs/smartbugs-curated
  Commit            : 230e649123477eff332742a59a1c7cc6dc286cab  (retrieved 2026-11-14)
  Repository code   : Apache License 2.0

IMPORTANT: the SmartBugs repository is Apache-2.0, but each example contract retains the
license of its ORIGINAL source. A per-file license review was performed (see ground-truth.tsv
and each file header) before copying any `.sol` into this MIT repository. Only license-clean,
portable files were imported; others are referenced by URL + commit only.

